From 335fc6fb6288847be3f21d577ba6b9204c134004 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 15:30:57 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [PERF MODE] Indicate performance mode in the
 battery icon

Observe the Health service's performance mode state and show a red battery
with a white flame while the mode is active or the thermal state remains
uncertain.

Give the performance indicator precedence over battery saver and charging
glyphs while preserving battery level and actual charging information.

Support the legacy battery renderer, unified drawable and Compose battery
pipeline, and include the performance warning in accessibility descriptions.

Change-Id: Idea07ac09c266f0d37c955b500f7314de2fb2c92
